OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain expected, along with
OL,7,Fstrengthening winds. However, some
OL,8,Fdrier intervals are also likely.
OL,9,FStrongest winds are likely through the
OL,10,Fafternoon and evening with coastal
OL,11,Fgales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with showers and rain,
OL,14,Fbecoming more settled and drier
OL,15,Fovernight with clearing skies from the
OL,16,Fwest. Winds will ease slightly by the
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
